Cell["\<\
This self-contained notebook reads no external .wl file. Choose Evaluation > \
Evaluate Notebook to run all four groups in order and generate the detailed \
report, summary table and PDF. The default example is (r,s,k)=(12,1,1).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e538200a-a48a-584f-ac16-a6a9216b679c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Chapters 2-3: periodic bounds and the root-of-unity sum", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"ae00f114-689c-8b41-b633-3901b29c2b14"],

Cell["\<\
P4, PEven and POdd implement P_3, P_{2,s} and P_{2,r-s}. EpsilonMin and \
EpsilonMax are theoretical lower and upper bounds for the periodic term, not \
its exact extrema. The root-of-unity formula is also checked numerically.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dfbff8c1-cb4e-7748-8651-d96ad5d2ed9a"],

