Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Chapters 3-4: exact finite polynomial checks", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"804a0ff4-98be-d248-8ebd-2ec9828cb0d7"],

Cell["\<\
The default example is (r,s,k)=(12,1,1). Interpolation, roots and \
coefficients use exact arithmetic. The finite check includes n_b and the next \
200 coefficients. In general-residue mode the reported threshold is \
sufficient and may exceed the one obtained from exact periodic extrema.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"be78bde1-ce02-3149-8030-6571f6cfc3a1"],

