Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Chapter 6: assemble the final explicit threshold", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f0528f41-6aeb-8546-9777-bc7efaf43433"],

Cell["\<\
The 22-field report combines n_b, N_b, the analytic scales and N_b^*. The \
field N0 is the shifted sufficient threshold delta0+NbStar. \
NormalizedThreshold and GeneralThreshold give the reduced and gcd-rescaled \
thresholds. The last input cell exports the summary PDF beside this notebook.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"77d282f5-19f9-3149-937a-150d62ef4540"],

