Cell["\<\
After a full run, check that closedFormChecks[\"AllChecks\"], \
rootOfUnityCheck[\"Passed\"], certificate[\"AllSafetyChecks\"] and \
report1211[\"Verification\"][\"StrictlyPositive\"] are True. The \
root-of-unity check is numerical, and the Mellin tail bound is supplied by \
the manuscript.\
